# Design system (always)

Stack: **React Native + Expo + Uniwind (Tailwind v4)**. Theme lives in `global.css`.

## Progressive layers (never skip)

```
docs/01-primitives.md  →  raw values (only when editing global.css)
docs/02-tokens.md      →  semantic tokens (names + meaning)
global.css             →  runtime implementation (light + dark)
docs/03-usage.md       →  component patterns (JSX / className)
src/themeColors.ts     →  JS hex mirror for native APIs only (Switch, icon color)
```

**Before styling UI:** read `docs/02-tokens.md`. **Before new patterns:** read `docs/03-usage.md`.

## Golden rules

- Components use **semantic token classes only** — `bg-canvas`, `text-accent`, `border-border`, `rounded-field`.
- **Never** in components: raw hex (`#2563eb`), arbitrary brackets (`bg-[#…]`), or Tailwind primitives (`bg-gray-950`).
- Need a new meaning? Add to `docs/02-tokens.md` + `global.css` (@variant light **and** dark). Then use the class.
- Need JS color (Switch, Phosphor `color`)? Use `src/themeColors.ts` hooks — keep in sync with `global.css`.

## Typography pairs

- Headings: `font-heading` + `text-heading-*` (Abril Fatface)
- Everything else: `font-body` + `text-body-*` (Inclusive Sans)
- Never cross pairs (`font-heading text-body-sm` is invalid)

## Color roles in this app

- **Accent** (`text-accent`, `bg-accent`) — brand blue, links, selected UI
- **Success** (`text-success`, `bg-success-soft`) — delivered, rewards, veg markers — stays green
- **Muted** (`text-muted`) — secondary/disabled copy (e.g. countdown text, meta labels)
- **Subtle** (`text-subtle`) — description under page/sheet/modal headings (2 steps toward canvas: lighter gray in light, dimmer gray in dark)
- **Destructive** (`text-destructive`) — errors

## Auth / sheet patterns (reference: `App.tsx`)

- Sheet: `rounded-sheet bg-canvas p-sheet gap-sheet-gap`
- Fields: `rounded-field h-field bg-field`; focused → `border-foreground bg-canvas`; values → `font-body-medium text-body-md tracking-body-md`
- OTP cells: `h-otp-cell rounded-field`; active → `border-foreground bg-canvas`
- Primary CTA: `AuthPrimaryButton` — `rounded-button-outer`, black fill (not accent)
